  "reading": {
    "zh": "按一次事故的脉络读：采集事实（证据 / 运行时采样 / 注入现场时间线 / 启动时间线 / 日志 / 设备 / 机器稳定性）→ 判定是不是崩了、崩在哪 → 记住它 → 把现场打包给人看 → 继续盯守。启动时间线是其中唯一一条「量启动本身」的线，用来把「慢在解压、慢在窗口、还是慢在首屏取数」分开。",
    "en": "Follow one incident: collect the facts (evidence, runtime sampling, injection timeline, startup timeline, logs, device, machine stability) → judge whether/where it crashed → remember it → package the scene → keep watching. The startup timeline is the only one that measures startup itself, separating extraction, window init, and the first state fetch."
